# Privacy Policy for Trivia Time

**Effective Date:** November 15, 2026  
**Last Updated:** November 15, 2026  

**Trivia Time** ("we," "our," or "us") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the information processed through our content management and publishing application (the "Service"). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect information when you connect your TikTok account to the Service.

---

## 1. Information We Collect
When you authorize Trivia Time to interact with your TikTok account via the TikTok API, we only access and process the minimum data required to perform content publishing and management functions:
* **Account & Authorization Data:** TikTok OAuth access tokens, refresh tokens, and basic profile identifiers (such as your TikTok display name and open ID) needed to authenticate and upload videos on your behalf.
* **Content & Media Data:** Video files, titles, descriptions, hashtags, and scheduling metadata submitted to the Service for publishing to your TikTok channel.

We do **not** collect sensitive personal data, passwords, private direct messages, or unrelated personal contacts.

## 2. How We Use Information
We use the collected information strictly to:
* Authenticate your authorized TikTok session.
* Upload, schedule, and publish educational trivia videos and accompanying metadata to your TikTok account.
* Troubleshoot publishing errors and maintain the reliability of the Service.

We do **not** sell, rent, trade, or monetize your personal data or TikTok API data to third parties.

## 3. Data Storage and Security
* Authorization tokens and media assets are stored securely and accessed solely by automated publishing workflows configured for Trivia Time.
* We implement reasonable technical and administrative safeguards to prevent unauthorized access, disclosure, or misuse of stored tokens and content.

## 4. Data Retention and Deletion
* We retain OAuth tokens and video assets only for as long as necessary to complete scheduled uploads and maintain active account authorization.
* **Revoking Access & Deletion:** You may revoke Trivia Time's access at any time via **TikTok Settings > Security and login > Manage app permissions**. Upon revocation or request, associated access tokens and cached media files are permanently deleted.

## 5. Third-Party Platform Policies
Our use and transfer of information received from TikTok APIs adhere strictly to the **TikTok Developer Terms of Service** and **TikTok Privacy Policy**.

## 6. Children's Privacy
The Service is a creator management tool intended for channel administrators and is not directed to individuals under the age of 13.

## 7. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect operational or regulatory changes. Updates will be reflected by the "Last Updated" date at the top of this document.

